    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">A building contains a single hallway and <var>r</var> rooms, each with only <const>1</const> door. All doors lead to the hallway.<br><br>Given <var>n</var> paths in the form of a pair of room numbers, representing a start room <var>a</var> and a destination room <var>b</var>, labelled from <const>1</const> to <var>r</var> inclusive, find the amount of times each door was opened.<br><br>Output the result for each door, sorted by room number, separated by spaces.<br>All doors are closed at the start and immediately after each use.<br><br><strong>Example:</strong><br><var>r</var> = 3<br><var>n</var> = 2<br><var>a</var> = 1, <var>b</var> = 2<br>A person starts in room 1, they enter the hallway via room 1's door, then they enter room 2 from the hallway via room 2's door.<br><var>a</var> = 2, <var>b</var> = 3<br>A person starts in room 2, they enter the hallway via room 2's door, then room 3 via room 3's door.<br>output: <strong>1 2 1</strong></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> The number of doors/rooms <var>r</var><br><strong>Line 2:</strong> Number of paths taken from one room to another <var>n</var><br><strong>Next <var>n</var> Lines:</strong> <const>2</const> space-separated values: the start room number <var>a</var> and the destination room number <var>b</var></div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong> <const>1</const> Line:</strong> <var>r</var> space-separated values: the number of times each door was opened, sorted by room number</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">2&le;<var>r</var>&le;100<br>0&le;<var>n</var>&le;100<br><var>a</var> &ne; <var>b</var></div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">3\n2\n1 2\n2 3</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">1 2 1</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
